    "snippet": "Due to all the dry air across our region this weekend, there will be mostly clear skies with zero chances for showers or storms. As a result NBM/WPC PoPs for the end of next week have 30-50% chance of showers and storms across the higher terrain in southern Gila County and around 10-20% across the lower deserts of south-central AZ.",
